---
import SkylineMark from "../SkylineMark.astro";
---

<section id="project" class="home-mission" aria-labelledby="home-mission-title">
  <div class="home-mission__inner">
    <div class="mission-grid">
      <div class="mission-statement">
        <div class="mission-statement__mark" aria-hidden="true"><SkylineMark /></div>
        <header>
          <span>Why Windgram exists</span>
          <h2 id="home-mission-title">Built for free flight</h2>
        </header>
        <p>
          Clubs and pilots can generate model-derived profiles and publish their own windgrams with
          inspectable, reusable, open tools.
        </p>
      </div>

      <article>
        <p class="mission-grid__label">Lineage</p>
        <h3>Built with gratitude for canadarasp</h3>
        <p>
          Windgram descends from <a href="https://github.com/ajberkley/canadarasp#readme">canadarasp</a>,
          whose open operations made this work possible to study and whose constants anchored the
          first faithful derivation ports. The projects now do different jobs; the debt remains worth naming.
        </p>
      </article>

      <article>
        <p class="mission-grid__label">First downstream publisher</p>
        <h3>Acrophobia was the first downstream publisher</h3>
        <p>
          <a href="https://acrophobia.ca">acrophobia.ca</a> consumes the published artifacts and
          applies its own access, current-results presentation, and operational context to them.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <nav class="mission-links" aria-label="Continue reading about the project">
      <a href="/about/">Read why the project exists <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      <a href="/docs/overview/">Explore the project architecture <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .home-mission {
    padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem);
  }

  .home-mission__inner {
    width: min(74.25rem, calc(100% - 3.5rem));
    margin-inline: auto;
  }

  .mission-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr 0.85fr;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }

  .mission-grid .mission-statement,
  .mission-grid article {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    border-inline-end: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .mission-grid article:last-child {
    border-inline-end: 0;
  }

  .mission-grid .mission-statement {
    display: grid;
    align-content: space-between;
    min-height: 23rem;
    color: var(--surface);
    background: var(--accent-strong);
  }

  .mission-statement__mark {
    width: 5.5rem;
    color: var(--surface-accent);
  }

  .mission-grid .mission-statement :global(svg) {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .mission-statement header {
    margin-block: 3rem;
  }

  .mission-statement header span {
    color: var(--surface-accent);
    font: 700 0.66rem/1.4 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .mission-statement h2 {
    margin: 0.65rem 0 0;
    color: var(--surface);
    font-size: clamp(3.3rem, 6vw, 5.5rem);
    line-height: 0.85;
  }

  .mission-grid .mission-statement > p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.8vw, 1.2rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .mission-grid article {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 72%, transparent);
  }

  .mission-grid__label {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    font: 700 0.65rem/1.4 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.07em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .mission-grid h3 {
    margin: 3.5rem 0 0.85rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.55rem, 2.6vw, 2.15rem);
    line-height: 0.96;
  }

  .mission-grid article > p:last-child {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .mission-links {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  }

  .mission-links a {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    color: var(--ink);
    background: var(--surface-raised);
    border-inline: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    font: 700 0.7rem/1.4 var(--mono);
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .mission-links a + a {
    border-inline-start: 0;
  }

  .mission-links a:hover {
    color: var(--accent-strong);
    background: var(--surface-accent);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 58rem) {
    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }

    .mission-grid .mission-statement {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
      min-height: 18rem;
      border-inline-end: 0;
      border-block-end: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 39rem) {
    .home-mission__inner {
      width: min(100% - 2rem, 74.25rem);
    }

    .mission-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .mission-grid .mission-statement {
      grid-column: auto;
    }

    .mission-grid article {
      border-inline-end: 0;
      border-block-end: 1px solid var(--rule);
    }

    .mission-grid article:last-child {
      border-block-end: 0;
    }

    .mission-grid h3 {
      margin-block-start: 2.2rem;
    }

    .mission-links {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .mission-links a + a {
      border-inline-start: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    }
  }
</style>
